=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Ranpi-Monpi} at the Culinarian's Guild (D-9).
* Go to {z:Giddeus} via {z:West Sarutabaruta}.
* Enter the caves via (F-8) or (I-8), behind where you dropped the offering for {M:Windurst Mission 1-3|Windurst Mission 1-3|The Price of Peace}.
* Head to the lower level of the caves, where you'll find a storage room at (G-6).
* Click on the altar to retrieve the {@k} {k:Off offering}.
* Return the key item to {p:Ranpi-Monpi} to complete the quest.

=2 Notes
